repository-code: "https://github.com/KevinTCoughlin/godot-device-power"
url: "https://github.com/KevinTCoughlin/godot-device-power"
abstract: >-
  A Godot 4 addon that reports where a device's power comes from, battery
  saver, Android Game Mode and thermal status, and turns them into a frame cap
  and a display frame rate vote, with a Kotlin Android plugin that pushes
  changes and votes on Godot's render surface.
keywords:
  - godot
  - android
  - battery
  - thermal
  - frame-rate
  - game-mode
